# Payment Invoice
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Payments — the receivable a customer's payment must eventually satisfy
# Case 8 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)

Invoice

Fields

- Invoice Number : Text
- Customer Name : Text
- Amount Due : Money
- Amount Paid : Money
- Status : Unpaid | Partially Paid | Paid
- Due Date : Date

Constraints

- Invoice Number is required.
- Customer Name is required.
- Amount Due is required.

Permissions

Finance

- View

Views

- Invoice Form : Form
- Invoice List : List
- Unpaid Invoices : List
- Invoice Detail : Detail
